  "text_md": "# KEYNOTE SPEAKER BIOGRAPHIES CONFLICT OF INTEREST DISCLOSURES\n\n### ◊ = Planning committee members\n\n## DISCLOSURES\n\n### Speaker Details\n\nChappell, Kathy I am a member of an advisory board for Pfizer and Merck. I receive no honoraria. Travel costs are reimbursed to employer. Gordon, Jennifer ◊ I am a member of a global educational advisory board for Pfizer and Merck-Sorono. Grad, Roland I received honoraria from the International Centre for Evidence Based Medicine for two online modules. Lalla, Leonora ◊ I have received dividends as a minor shareholder in a medical clinic in Pierrefonds, Quebec. Outschoorn, Amy ◊ I have received compensation from industry for travel expenses only, for sitting on a board of directors for Food Allergy Canada and the Canadian Premature Babies Foundation. Smith, Karen I have received or will be receiving a grant or honorarium from Shire Pharmaceuticals for contributing to an investigator initiated research grant. The Queen's CPD department has received payment from commercial organizations in support of programming. I do not receive personal support or gifts. Sockalingam, Sanjeev I have received or will be receiving a grant or honorarium from Shire Pharmaceuticals for contributing to an investigator initiated research grant. Switzer, Connie ◊ I am a member of an advisory board for Abbvie and Merck.\n\n## NOTHING TO DECLARE\n\n|8TH NATIONAL CPD ACCREDITATION CONFERENCE|• OCTOBER 17 & 18, 2016|\n|---|---|\n|SHERATON TORONTO AIRPORT HOTEL & CONFERENCE CENTRE|• 801 DIXON ROAD|\n||27|\n\n|Archibald, Doug|Harvey, Janice ◊|Sargeant, Joan|\n|---|---|---|\n|Black, Jessica ◊|Lawrence, Susanne|Sisler, Jeff|\n|Brien, Susan|Leblanc, Connie ◊|Thorgeirson, Jennifer|\n|Campbell, Craig|Matlow, Anne|Wade, Patricia ◊|\n|Chmelicek, John ◊|Mazurek, Karen ◊|Walton, Mark|\n|Daniel, Sam|Meuser, Jamie|Warken, Mya ◊|\n|Davis, Dave|Newton, Christie ◊|Wong, Brian|\n|Fleming, Michael ◊|Parson, Bob ◊|Woodard, Amanda ◊|\n|Galioto, Riccarda ◊|Ripley, Cheryl ◊||\n\n- TORONTO, ON\n",
